%% Work-item lifecycle v0. Generated by `python -m z0int.fsm.export --mermaid`
%% from src/z0int/fsm/work_item.py TRANSITIONS; laws L1-L7 are proven in
%% bend/work_item_fsm (PROOF.bend). Edge label: event [roles] (law).
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Proposed
    Proposed --> Claimed : Claim [opus,sol]
    Claimed --> Implementing : Start [author]
    Implementing --> Implementing : Push [author]
    Implementing --> Verifying : Submit [author]
    Verifying --> DraftPR : Verify(pass, sha==head) [ci] L3
    Verifying --> Implementing : Verify(fail or other sha) [ci]
    DraftPR --> Integrated : Integrate [ci,opus] L3
    Integrated --> Deployed : Deploy [ci,opus] L4
    Deployed --> Integrated : Observe(served != integrated) [ci] L4
    Deployed --> OwnerAccepted : Accept [owner] L7
    OwnerAccepted --> Merged : Merge [ci,owner] L1
    Implementing --> Blocked : Block [any]
    Verifying --> Blocked : Block [any]
    Blocked --> Implementing : Unblock [owner,opus]
    Claimed --> Interrupted : Interrupt [any]
    Implementing --> Interrupted : Interrupt [any]
    Verifying --> Interrupted : Interrupt [any]
    Interrupted --> Implementing : Resume [opus,sol] L5
    Interrupted --> Abandoned : Abandon [owner,opus] L5
    Blocked --> Abandoned : Abandon [owner,opus]
    Claimed --> Abandoned : Abandon [owner,opus]
    Proposed --> Abandoned : Abandon [owner,opus]
    Merged --> [*]
    Abandoned --> [*]
    note right of Deployed
        needs-Kevin queue (L7): acceptance waits for his next
        deep-work block or low-energy phone review; other items keep moving
    end note
    note left of Interrupted
        L5: leaves only by Resume (head kept) or Abandon;
        replay checker flags any left past the TTL
    end note
    classDef side fill:#2a2a2a,stroke:#c77,color:#eee
    classDef owner fill:#24324a,stroke:#7af,color:#eee
    class Blocked,Interrupted,Abandoned side
    class OwnerAccepted owner
